\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Architectural comparison across four knowledge graph construction and reasoning paradigms for hybrid table-text retrieval. In contrast to offline STI cascades\nobreakspace  {}(a), unconstrained zero-shot LLM extraction\nobreakspace  {}(b), and aggressive top-$k$ path pruning in persistent GraphRAG systems\nobreakspace  {}(c), the proposed OUEG-RAG framework\nobreakspace  {}(d) dynamically instantiates a schema-preserving multigraph on-the-fly without LLM calls, retains retrieved multigraph context via compact prompt encoding, and guides single-turn reasoning via candidate path routing.}}{4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:paradigms}{{1}{4}}
